WEBVTT

NOTE Invented narration for the synthetic demo video.

intro-1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
<v Narrator>Welcome to a short tour of colour and shape.

intro-2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Narrator>Everything you see here was generated, frame by frame.

red-1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Narrator>We start with red, the warmest of the three.

red-2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
<v Narrator>A single white square gives the eye somewhere to rest.

blue-1
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Guide>Blue arrives next, cooler and calmer.

blue-2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
<v Guide>Repeated stripes create a sense of rhythm.

green-1
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
<v Narrator>Green brings a grid of evenly spaced tiles.

green-2
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
<v Narrator>Notice how the gaps matter as much as the tiles.

mix-1
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
<v Guide>When translucent colours overlap, new colours appear.

mix-2
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Guide>Red over blue, blue over green: every overlap is a new mix.

outro-1
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Narrator>That is the whole tour, in under a minute.

outro-2
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
<v Narrator>Click any line in this transcript to jump back to it.
